"""Hand-written networking concept rows: (group, term, en, fr, rw, sw) where the four texts describe the term. Used by quiz_net.py.
fr/rw/sw wording is a draft for review by fluent speakers."""
ROWS = [
# ---- devices
("devices","Router","A device that forwards packets between different networks using IP addresses.","Appareil qui transmet les paquets entre des réseaux différents à l'aide des adresses IP.","Igikoresho cyohereza udupaki hagati y'imiyoboro itandukanye hakoreshejwe aderesi za IP.","Kifaa kinachosambaza pakiti kati ya mitandao tofauti kwa kutumia anwani za IP."),
("devices","Switch","A device that connects computers in one LAN and forwards frames only to the port of the destination MAC address.","Appareil qui relie des ordinateurs d'un même LAN et envoie les trames uniquement vers le port de l'adresse MAC de destination.","Igikoresho gihuza mudasobwa muri LAN imwe kikohereza amakadiri gusa kuri port y'aderesi ya MAC igenewe.","Kifaa kinachounganisha kompyuta katika LAN moja na kutuma fremu kwenye mlango wa anwani ya MAC lengwa pekee."),
("devices","Hub","An old device that repeats every incoming signal to all its ports, so all connected computers share the same collision domain.","Ancien appareil qui répète chaque signal reçu vers tous ses ports ; tous les ordinateurs partagent le même domaine de collision.","Igikoresho cya kera gisubiza buri kimenyetso cyinjiye kuri port zose, bityo mudasobwa zose zigasangira domaine imwe y'impanuka.","Kifaa cha zamani kinachorudia kila ishara kwenye milango yote, hivyo kompyuta zote hushiriki eneo moja la mgongano."),
("devices","Access point","A device that lets wireless clients join a wired network.","Appareil qui permet aux clients sans fil de rejoindre un réseau filaire.","Igikoresho gifasha ibikoresho bidafite insinga kwinjira mu muyoboro ufite insinga.","Kifaa kinachoruhusu vifaa visivyo na waya kujiunga na mtandao wa waya."),
("devices","Modem","A device that converts digital data to a signal suited to the line (telephone, cable, fibre) and back.","Appareil qui convertit les données numériques en un signal adapté à la ligne (téléphone, câble, fibre) et inversement.","Igikoresho gihindura amakuru ya digitale mu kimenyetso gikwiye umurongo (telefoni, cable, fibre) kandi kigasubiza.","Kifaa kinachobadilisha data ya kidijitali kuwa ishara inayofaa laini (simu, kebo, fiber) na kinyume chake."),
("devices","Firewall","A device or program that allows or blocks traffic according to security rules.","Appareil ou programme qui autorise ou bloque le trafic selon des règles de sécurité.","Igikoresho cyangwa porogaramu yemerera cyangwa ihagarika urujya n'uruza hakurikijwe amategeko y'umutekano.","Kifaa au programu inayoruhusu au kuzuia trafiki kulingana na kanuni za usalama."),
("devices","Repeater","A device that regenerates a weakening signal so it can travel farther.","Appareil qui régénère un signal qui s'affaiblit pour qu'il aille plus loin.","Igikoresho gisubiza imbaraga ikimenyetso kigenda gicogora kugira ngo kigere kure.","Kifaa kinachorejesha nguvu ya ishara inayodhoofika ili isafiri mbali zaidi."),
("devices","Load balancer","A device that spreads incoming requests across several servers.","Appareil qui répartit les requêtes entrantes entre plusieurs serveurs.","Igikoresho kigabanya ibisabwa byinjira hagati ya seriveri nyinshi.","Kifaa kinachogawa maombi yanayoingia kati ya seva kadhaa."),
("devices","Gateway","The node that connects a network to another network, often the router a host uses to leave its subnet.","Nœud qui relie un réseau à un autre, souvent le routeur qu'un hôte utilise pour quitter son sous-réseau.","Ikoresho rihuza umuyoboro n'undi, akenshi ni router mudasobwa ikoresha kugira ngo ive muri subnet yayo.","Nodi inayounganisha mtandao na mtandao mwingine, mara nyingi kipanga njia ambacho kompyuta hutumia kutoka nje ya subnet yake."),
("devices","Proxy server","A server that makes requests on behalf of clients and can filter or cache the answers.","Serveur qui fait des requêtes au nom des clients et peut filtrer ou mettre en cache les réponses.","Seriveri ikora ibisabwa mu izina ry'abakiriya ikaba yakayungurura cyangwa ikabika ibisubizo.","Seva inayofanya maombi kwa niaba ya wateja na inaweza kuchuja au kuhifadhi majibu."),
# ---- protocols
("protocols","DHCP","Gives devices an IP address, mask, gateway and DNS server automatically.","Donne automatiquement aux appareils une adresse IP, un masque, une passerelle et un serveur DNS.","Iha ibikoresho aderesi ya IP, mask, gateway na seriveri ya DNS mu buryo bwikora.","Hutoa kwa vifaa anwani ya IP, barakoa, lango na seva ya DNS kiotomatiki."),
("protocols","DNS","Translates names such as example.com into IP addresses.","Traduit les noms comme example.com en adresses IP.","Ihindura amazina nka example.com mu maaderesi ya IP.","Hutafsiri majina kama example.com kuwa anwani za IP."),
("protocols","ARP","Finds the MAC address that belongs to a known IPv4 address on the local network.","Trouve l'adresse MAC correspondant à une adresse IPv4 connue sur le réseau local.","Isanga aderesi ya MAC ihuye na aderesi ya IPv4 izwi mu muyoboro waho.","Hutafuta anwani ya MAC inayolingana na anwani ya IPv4 inayojulikana katika mtandao wa ndani."),
("protocols","ICMP","Carries error and control messages such as echo requests used by ping.","Transporte des messages d'erreur et de contrôle, comme les requêtes d'écho utilisées par ping.","Ihererekanya ubutumwa bw'amakosa n'ubugenzuzi nka echo requests zikoreshwa na ping.","Hubeba ujumbe wa makosa na udhibiti kama maombi ya echo yanayotumiwa na ping."),
("protocols","NTP","Keeps the clocks of computers synchronised.","Maintient les horloges des ordinateurs synchronisées.","Ituma amasaha ya mudasobwa ahuza.","Huweka saa za kompyuta zikiwa zimeoanishwa."),
("protocols","SNMP","Lets administrators monitor and manage network devices.","Permet aux administrateurs de surveiller et gérer les équipements réseau.","Yemerera abayobozi gukurikirana no gucunga ibikoresho by'umuyoboro.","Huruhusu wasimamizi kufuatilia na kusimamia vifaa vya mtandao."),
("protocols","FTP","Transfers files between a client and a server, and sends passwords in clear text.","Transfère des fichiers entre un client et un serveur et envoie les mots de passe en clair.","Yohereza dosiye hagati y'umukiriya na seriveri kandi yohereza amagambo y'ibanga mu buryo bugaragara.","Huhamisha faili kati ya mteja na seva na hutuma nywila kwa maandishi wazi."),
("protocols","SMTP","Sends email from a client to a server and between mail servers.","Envoie le courrier électronique d'un client vers un serveur et entre serveurs de messagerie.","Yohereza email kuva ku mukiriya ujya kuri seriveri no hagati ya seriveri z'ubutumwa.","Hutuma barua pepe kutoka kwa mteja hadi seva na kati ya seva za barua."),
("protocols","TCP","A reliable, connection-oriented transport protocol with a three-way handshake and retransmission.","Protocole de transport fiable, orienté connexion, avec poignée de main en trois temps et retransmission.","Protocole yo gutwara amakuru yizewe, ishingiye ku isano, ifite three-way handshake no kongera kohereza.","Itifaki ya usafirishaji ya kuaminika, inayoegemea muunganisho, yenye three-way handshake na kutuma upya."),
("protocols","UDP","A fast, connectionless transport protocol with no delivery guarantee, used for voice, video and DNS queries.","Protocole de transport rapide, sans connexion et sans garantie de livraison, utilisé pour la voix, la vidéo et les requêtes DNS.","Protocole yihuta idafite isano kandi idatanga icyizere cyo kugezwa, ikoreshwa ku jwi, amashusho n'ibibazo bya DNS.","Itifaki ya usafirishaji ya haraka isiyo na muunganisho wala uhakika wa kufikisha, hutumika kwa sauti, video na maswali ya DNS."),
("protocols","HTTPS","HTTP carried inside TLS so the traffic is encrypted and the server is authenticated.","HTTP transporté dans TLS : le trafic est chiffré et le serveur authentifié.","HTTP inyuze muri TLS bityo urujya n'uruza rukaba rufite encryption kandi seriveri ikamenyekana.","HTTP inayobebwa ndani ya TLS hivyo trafiki husimbwa na seva huthibitishwa."),
("protocols","SSH","Gives encrypted remote command-line access and replaces Telnet.","Donne un accès distant chiffré en ligne de commande et remplace Telnet.","Itanga uburyo bwo kwinjira kure bufite encryption kandi isimbura Telnet.","Hutoa ufikiaji wa mbali wa mstari wa amri uliosimbwa na kuchukua nafasi ya Telnet."),
# ---- DNS records
("dns","A record","Maps a domain name to an IPv4 address.","Associe un nom de domaine à une adresse IPv4.","Ihuza izina rya domaine na aderesi ya IPv4.","Huunganisha jina la kikoa na anwani ya IPv4."),
("dns","AAAA record","Maps a domain name to an IPv6 address.","Associe un nom de domaine à une adresse IPv6.","Ihuza izina rya domaine na aderesi ya IPv6.","Huunganisha jina la kikoa na anwani ya IPv6."),
("dns","MX record","Tells which mail servers accept email for a domain.","Indique quels serveurs de messagerie acceptent le courrier d'un domaine.","Ivuga seriveri z'ubutumwa zemera email za domaine.","Huonyesha seva za barua zinazopokea barua pepe za kikoa."),
("dns","CNAME record","Makes one name an alias of another name.","Fait d'un nom un alias d'un autre nom.","Igira izina rimwe ishusho y'irindi zina.","Hufanya jina moja kuwa kisawe cha jina jingine."),
("dns","NS record","Names the authoritative name servers of a zone.","Désigne les serveurs de noms faisant autorité pour une zone.","Ivuga seriveri z'amazina zifite ububasha kuri zone.","Hutaja seva za majina zenye mamlaka kwa eneo."),
("dns","PTR record","Used for reverse lookup, mapping an IP address back to a name.","Sert à la résolution inverse : associe une adresse IP à un nom.","Ikoreshwa mu gushakisha ku buryo bunyuranye, ihuza aderesi ya IP n'izina.","Hutumika kwa utafutaji kinyume, kuunganisha anwani ya IP na jina."),
("dns","TXT record","Holds free text, often used for SPF, DKIM and domain verification.","Contient du texte libre, souvent utilisé pour SPF, DKIM et la vérification de domaine.","Ibika inyandiko yisanzuye, ikunze gukoreshwa kuri SPF, DKIM no kwemeza domaine.","Huhifadhi maandishi huru, mara nyingi kwa SPF, DKIM na uthibitisho wa kikoa."),
("dns","SOA record","Holds administrative data of a zone such as the primary server and the serial number.","Contient les données administratives d'une zone, comme le serveur primaire et le numéro de série.","Ibika amakuru y'ubuyobozi bwa zone nka seriveri nkuru n'inomero y'uruhererekane.","Huhifadhi data ya usimamizi ya eneo kama seva kuu na nambari ya mfululizo."),
# ---- commands
("commands","ping","Tests whether a host can be reached and how long the round trip takes.","Teste si un hôte est joignable et mesure le temps aller-retour.","Igerageza niba mudasobwa ishobora kugerwaho ikanapima igihe cy'urugendo rwo kujya no kugaruka.","Hujaribu kama mwenyeji anafikika na muda wa safari ya kwenda na kurudi."),
("commands","traceroute","Shows the routers a packet passes through on the way to a destination.","Affiche les routeurs que traverse un paquet jusqu'à sa destination.","Yerekana ba router agapaki kanyuramo kageze iyo kajya.","Huonyesha vipanga njia ambavyo pakiti hupitia hadi inakoelekea."),
("commands","nslookup","Queries a DNS server to resolve a name.","Interroge un serveur DNS pour résoudre un nom.","Ibaza seriveri ya DNS kugira ngo isobanure izina.","Huuliza seva ya DNS kutatua jina."),
("commands","netstat","Lists active connections and listening ports on the computer.","Liste les connexions actives et les ports en écoute sur l'ordinateur.","Itondagura ihuzwa rikora na port zumva kuri mudasobwa.","Huorodhesha miunganisho inayofanya kazi na milango inayosikiliza kwenye kompyuta."),
("commands","ipconfig","Displays the IP configuration of the network adapters on Windows.","Affiche la configuration IP des cartes réseau sous Windows.","Yerekana imiterere ya IP y'amakarita y'umuyoboro kuri Windows.","Huonyesha usanidi wa IP wa kadi za mtandao kwenye Windows."),
("commands","nmap","Scans a network to find hosts, open ports and services.","Analyse un réseau pour trouver des hôtes, des ports ouverts et des services.","Isuzuma umuyoboro ishaka mudasobwa, port zifunguye na serivisi.","Hukagua mtandao kutafuta wenyeji, milango iliyo wazi na huduma."),
("commands","tcpdump","Captures and displays packets on a network interface from the command line.","Capture et affiche les paquets d'une interface réseau en ligne de commande.","Ifata ikanerekana udupaki kuri interface y'umuyoboro mu murongo w'amategeko.","Hunasa na kuonyesha pakiti kwenye kiolesura cha mtandao kwa mstari wa amri."),
("commands","arp -a","Shows the table that maps IP addresses to MAC addresses on the local network.","Affiche la table qui associe adresses IP et adresses MAC sur le réseau local.","Yerekana imbonerahamwe ihuza aderesi za IP na aderesi za MAC mu muyoboro waho.","Huonyesha jedwali linalounganisha anwani za IP na anwani za MAC katika mtandao wa ndani."),
# ---- media and wireless
("media","Fibre optic cable","Carries data as pulses of light and is immune to electrical interference over long distances.","Transporte les données sous forme d'impulsions lumineuses et ne craint pas les interférences électriques sur de longues distances.","Itwara amakuru nk'ibimenyetso by'urumuri kandi nta byo yangizwa n'ibinyoteri by'amashanyarazi mu ntera ndende.","Hubeba data kama mipigo ya mwanga na haistahimili usumbufu wa umeme kwa umbali mrefu."),
("media","UTP cable","A common copper cable of twisted pairs, used in Ethernet LANs with RJ-45 connectors.","Câble en cuivre courant à paires torsadées, utilisé dans les LAN Ethernet avec des connecteurs RJ-45.","Insinga ya umuringa isanzwe y'imirongo ihinye, ikoreshwa muri LAN za Ethernet hamwe na RJ-45.","Kebo ya kawaida ya shaba ya jozi zilizosokotwa, hutumika katika LAN za Ethernet na viunganishi vya RJ-45."),
("media","Coaxial cable","A cable with a central conductor and a shield, used for cable TV and older Ethernet.","Câble à conducteur central et blindage, utilisé pour la télévision par câble et d'anciens Ethernet.","Insinga ifite umuyoboro rwagati n'agakingirizo, ikoreshwa kuri televiziyo ya cable na Ethernet za kera.","Kebo yenye kondakta ya kati na ngao, hutumika kwa TV ya kebo na Ethernet za zamani."),
("media","Crossover cable","A cable that connects two similar devices directly, such as two computers.","Câble qui relie directement deux appareils de même type, comme deux ordinateurs.","Insinga ihuza mu buryo butaziguye ibikoresho bibiri bimeze kimwe nka mudasobwa ebyiri.","Kebo inayounganisha moja kwa moja vifaa viwili vinavyofanana kama kompyuta mbili."),
("media","SSID","The name of a wireless network that appears in the list of Wi-Fi networks.","Nom d'un réseau sans fil affiché dans la liste des réseaux Wi-Fi.","Izina ry'umuyoboro udafite insinga rigaragara ku rutonde rw'imiyoboro ya Wi-Fi.","Jina la mtandao usio na waya linaloonekana kwenye orodha ya mitandao ya Wi-Fi."),
("media","WPA3","The current and strongest standard for securing Wi-Fi networks with encryption.","La norme actuelle et la plus robuste pour sécuriser les réseaux Wi-Fi par chiffrement.","Ni yo mahame agezweho kandi akomeye yo kurinda imiyoboro ya Wi-Fi hakoreshejwe encryption.","Kiwango cha sasa na imara zaidi cha kulinda mitandao ya Wi-Fi kwa usimbaji fiche."),
("media","Mesh network","A network where nodes connect to several others, giving many alternative paths.","Réseau où chaque nœud est relié à plusieurs autres, offrant de nombreux chemins alternatifs.","Umuyoboro aho buri node ihuzwa n'izindi nyinshi, bigatanga inzira nyinshi z'ubundi buryo.","Mtandao ambapo kila nodi huunganishwa na nyingine kadhaa, ukitoa njia mbadala nyingi."),
("media","Captive portal","A web page shown on a public Wi-Fi that must be accepted or signed into before getting internet access.","Page web affichée sur un Wi-Fi public qu'il faut accepter ou où il faut se connecter avant d'accéder à Internet.","Urupapuro rwa web rugaragara kuri Wi-Fi rusange ugomba kwemera cyangwa kwinjiraho mbere yo kubona internet.","Ukurasa wa wavuti unaoonekana kwenye Wi-Fi ya umma lazima ukubaliwe au kuingia kabla ya kupata intaneti."),
# ---- routing and switching
("routing","OSPF","A link-state routing protocol that finds the shortest path inside one organisation's network.","Protocole de routage à état de liens qui trouve le chemin le plus court au sein du réseau d'une organisation.","Protocole yo guhitamo inzira ishingiye ku link-state ibona inzira ngufi mu muyoboro w'ikigo kimwe.","Itifaki ya uelekezaji ya hali-ya-kiungo inayopata njia fupi zaidi ndani ya mtandao wa shirika moja."),
("routing","BGP","The routing protocol that exchanges routes between autonomous systems on the Internet.","Protocole de routage qui échange les routes entre systèmes autonomes sur Internet.","Protocole yo guhitamo inzira ihererekanya inzira hagati ya autonomous systems kuri Internet.","Itifaki ya uelekezaji inayobadilishana njia kati ya mifumo huru kwenye Intaneti."),
("routing","Static route","A route that an administrator enters by hand and that does not change by itself.","Route saisie à la main par un administrateur qui ne change pas d'elle-même.","Inzira yinjijwe n'intoki n'umuyobozi kandi itihindura ubwayo.","Njia iliyoingizwa kwa mkono na msimamizi na haibadiliki yenyewe."),
("routing","Default gateway","The router address a host uses to reach destinations outside its own subnet.","Adresse du routeur qu'un hôte utilise pour joindre des destinations hors de son sous-réseau.","Aderesi ya router mudasobwa ikoresha kugera ahandi hatari muri subnet yayo.","Anwani ya kipanga njia ambayo mwenyeji hutumia kufikia maeneo nje ya subnet yake."),
("routing","VLAN","A logical division of a switch into separate broadcast domains, whatever the physical location.","Division logique d'un commutateur en domaines de diffusion séparés, quel que soit l'emplacement physique.","Igabana rya logique rya switch mu ma domaine y'ikwirakwizwa atandukanye, aho byaba biri hose.","Mgawanyo wa kimantiki wa swichi kuwa maeneo tofauti ya matangazo, popote yalipo kimwili."),
("routing","Trunk port","A switch port that carries traffic of several VLANs, tagged with 802.1Q.","Port de commutateur qui transporte le trafic de plusieurs VLAN, marqué en 802.1Q.","Port ya switch itwara urujya n'uruza rwa VLAN nyinshi, rufite ikimenyetso cya 802.1Q.","Mlango wa swichi unaobeba trafiki ya VLAN kadhaa, iliyowekewa lebo ya 802.1Q."),
("routing","STP","Prevents switching loops by blocking redundant links until they are needed.","Empêche les boucles de commutation en bloquant les liens redondants jusqu'à ce qu'ils soient nécessaires.","Ibuza imirongo yo kuzenguruka ku switch ihagarika imiyoboro irenze kugeza ibaye ngombwa.","Huzuia mizunguko ya swichi kwa kuzuia viungo vya ziada hadi vihitajike."),
("routing","NAT","Translates private IP addresses to a public address so many devices can share one public IP.","Traduit les adresses IP privées en une adresse publique pour que plusieurs appareils partagent une IP publique.","Ihindura aderesi za IP z'ibanga mu aderesi rusange kugira ngo ibikoresho byinshi bisangire IP rusange imwe.","Hutafsiri anwani za IP za faragha kuwa anwani ya umma ili vifaa vingi vishiriki IP moja ya umma."),
("routing","Routing table","The list of known destinations and the next hop used to reach each of them.","Liste des destinations connues et du prochain saut utilisé pour atteindre chacune.","Urutonde rw'aho bijya bizwi n'intambwe ikurikira ikoreshwa kugira ngo bigerweho.","Orodha ya maeneo yanayojulikana na hatua inayofuata ya kufikia kila moja."),
("routing","Port forwarding","A rule that sends traffic arriving on a router port to a chosen internal device.","Règle qui envoie le trafic arrivant sur un port du routeur vers un appareil interne choisi.","Itegeko ryohereza urujya n'uruza rugeze kuri port ya router ku gikoresho cy'imbere cyatoranyijwe.","Kanuni inayopeleka trafiki inayofika kwenye mlango wa kipanga njia hadi kifaa cha ndani kilichochaguliwa."),
# ---- topologies and performance
("topology","Star topology","Every device connects to one central switch or hub.","Chaque appareil est relié à un commutateur ou concentrateur central.","Buri gikoresho gihuzwa na switch cyangwa hub imwe yo hagati.","Kila kifaa huunganishwa na swichi au hub moja ya kati."),
("topology","Bus topology","All devices share one single backbone cable.","Tous les appareils partagent un seul câble principal.","Ibikoresho byose bisangira insinga nkuru imwe.","Vifaa vyote hushiriki kebo moja kuu."),
("topology","Ring topology","Each device connects to exactly two neighbours, forming a closed loop.","Chaque appareil est relié à exactement deux voisins, formant une boucle fermée.","Buri gikoresho gihuzwa n'ibindi bibiri gusa, bigakora uruziga rufunze.","Kila kifaa huunganishwa na majirani wawili tu, kikiunda mzunguko uliofungwa."),
("topology","Bandwidth","The maximum amount of data a link can carry per second.","Quantité maximale de données qu'une liaison peut transporter par seconde.","Ingano ntarengwa y'amakuru umurongo ushobora gutwara mu isegonda.","Kiwango cha juu cha data ambacho kiungo kinaweza kubeba kwa sekunde."),
("topology","Latency","The delay a packet needs to travel from source to destination.","Délai que met un paquet pour aller de la source à la destination.","Igihe agapaki gafata kava aho katurutse kajya aho kagana.","Ucheleweshaji unaohitajika kwa pakiti kusafiri kutoka chanzo hadi lengo."),
("topology","Jitter","The variation in the delay between packets, which spoils voice and video calls.","Variation du délai entre les paquets, qui dégrade les appels voix et vidéo.","Itandukana ry'igihe hagati y'udupaki, ribangamira guhamagara kw'ijwi n'amashusho.","Tofauti ya ucheleweshaji kati ya pakiti, inayoharibu simu za sauti na video."),
("topology","Packet loss","Packets that never reach their destination, for example because of congestion or a bad link.","Paquets qui n'atteignent jamais leur destination, par exemple à cause d'une congestion ou d'un mauvais lien.","Udupaki tutagera aho tugenewe, urugero kubera ubucucike cyangwa umurongo mubi.","Pakiti ambazo hazifikii lengo lake, kwa mfano kwa sababu ya msongamano au kiungo kibovu."),
("topology","Peer-to-peer","A model in which computers share resources directly with each other without a central server.","Modèle où les ordinateurs partagent des ressources directement entre eux, sans serveur central.","Uburyo mudasobwa zisangira ibikoresho zitaziguye nta seriveri nkuru.","Mfumo ambapo kompyuta hushiriki rasilimali moja kwa moja bila seva kuu."),
("topology","Client-server","A model in which clients request services from a central, always-on server.","Modèle où des clients demandent des services à un serveur central toujours disponible.","Uburyo abakiriya basaba serivisi kuri seriveri nkuru ihora ikora.","Mfumo ambapo wateja huomba huduma kutoka kwa seva kuu inayofanya kazi daima."),
("topology","WAN","A network that covers a large geographic area, such as the links between cities or countries.","Réseau couvrant une grande zone géographique, comme les liaisons entre villes ou pays.","Umuyoboro ukwirakwira ahantu hanini, nk'imiyoboro ihuza imigi cyangwa ibihugu.","Mtandao unaofunika eneo kubwa la kijiografia, kama viungo kati ya miji au nchi."),
("topology","LAN","A network that covers a small area such as a home, school or office building.","Réseau couvrant une petite zone comme une maison, une école ou un bureau.","Umuyoboro ukwirakwira ahantu hato nk'inzu, ishuri cyangwa inyubako y'ibiro.","Mtandao unaofunika eneo dogo kama nyumba, shule au jengo la ofisi."),
# ---- network security
("netsec","VPN","Creates an encrypted tunnel across an untrusted network such as the Internet.","Crée un tunnel chiffré à travers un réseau non fiable comme Internet.","Ikora umuyoboro wa encryption unyura mu muyoboro utizewe nka Internet.","Huunda mfereji uliosimbwa kupitia mtandao usioaminika kama Intaneti."),
("netsec","DMZ","A separate network zone for public-facing servers, isolated from the internal LAN.","Zone réseau séparée pour les serveurs exposés au public, isolée du LAN interne.","Agace k'umuyoboro gatandukanye ka seriveri zerekanwa rubanda, gatandukanye na LAN y'imbere.","Eneo tofauti la mtandao kwa seva zinazotazama umma, lililotengwa na LAN ya ndani."),
("netsec","ACL","An ordered list of permit and deny rules that a router or firewall applies to traffic.","Liste ordonnée de règles d'autorisation et de refus appliquée par un routeur ou un pare-feu.","Urutonde rufite gahunda rw'amategeko yo kwemera no guhakana rukoreshwa na router cyangwa firewall.","Orodha yenye mpangilio ya kanuni za kuruhusu na kukataa inayotumiwa na kipanga njia au firewall."),
("netsec","IDS","Watches network traffic and raises alerts about suspicious activity without blocking it.","Surveille le trafic réseau et lève des alertes sur les activités suspectes sans les bloquer.","Ikurikirana urujya n'uruza ikatanga impuruza ku bikorwa bikemangwa itabihagaritse.","Hufuatilia trafiki ya mtandao na kutoa tahadhari kuhusu shughuli za kutiliwa shaka bila kuzizuia."),
("netsec","Port scan","Probing a host to discover which ports are open, used by administrators and by attackers.","Sonder un hôte pour découvrir quels ports sont ouverts, utilisé par les administrateurs comme par les attaquants.","Gusuzuma mudasobwa kugira ngo hamenyekane port zifunguye, bikoreshwa n'abayobozi n'abagizi ba nabi.","Kuchunguza mwenyeji kugundua milango iliyo wazi, hutumiwa na wasimamizi na washambuliaji."),
("netsec","ARP spoofing","Sending fake ARP replies so that traffic of other devices is sent to the attacker.","Envoyer de fausses réponses ARP pour que le trafic d'autres appareils soit dirigé vers l'attaquant.","Kohereza ibisubizo bya ARP by'ibinyoma kugira ngo urujya n'uruza rw'ibindi bikoresho rujye ku mugizi wa nabi.","Kutuma majibu bandia ya ARP ili trafiki ya vifaa vingine ielekezwe kwa mshambuliaji."),
("netsec","DNS spoofing","Giving false DNS answers so a victim is sent to a fake server.","Donner de fausses réponses DNS pour envoyer la victime vers un faux serveur.","Gutanga ibisubizo bya DNS by'ibinyoma kugira ngo uwahohotewe yoherezwe kuri seriveri y'impimbano.","Kutoa majibu ya uongo ya DNS ili mwathirika apelekwe kwenye seva bandia."),
("netsec","Rogue access point","An unauthorised wireless access point placed on a network, often to capture traffic.","Point d'accès sans fil non autorisé placé sur un réseau, souvent pour capturer le trafic.","Access point idafite uruhushya yashyizwe ku muyoboro, akenshi kugira ngo ifate urujya n'uruza.","Sehemu ya ufikiaji isiyoidhinishwa iliyowekwa kwenye mtandao, mara nyingi kunasa trafiki."),
("netsec","Network segmentation","Dividing a network into smaller zones so a problem or attacker cannot spread everywhere.","Diviser un réseau en zones plus petites pour qu'un problème ou un attaquant ne se propage pas partout.","Kugabanya umuyoboro mu duce duto kugira ngo ikibazo cyangwa umugizi wa nabi ntagere hose.","Kugawanya mtandao katika maeneo madogo ili tatizo au mshambuliaji asienee kila mahali."),
]
